[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3764184532","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115063#issuecomment-3764184532","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115063","id":3764184532,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gXOXU","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-17T18:24:58Z","updated_at":"2026-01-17T18:24:58Z","body":"Does this work when exporting without binary tokenization?\n\nIn general duplicating resources does only take publicly exposed properties into account. There is no magic happening with internal states. The only public property for a `Script` is its source code, but GDScripts are backed by binary tokens and not source code, at least in exported games. So I'd say it's kinda expected that duplicating a script by copying over its empty source code will result in an empty script.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3764184532/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3765495742","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115063#issuecomment-3765495742","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115063","id":3765495742,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gcOe-","user":{"login":"elmarhoppieland","id":114440420,"node_id":"U_kgDOBtI45A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114440420?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland","html_url":"https://github.com/elmarhoppieland","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elmarhoppieland/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-18T16:59:40Z","updated_at":"2026-01-18T16:59:40Z","body":"> Does this work when exporting without binary tokenization?\n\nAssuming you mean the project setting `editor/export/convert_text_resources_to_binary`, then I can confirm that the issue occurs even when it is disabled.\n\n> So I'd say it's kinda expected that duplicating a script by copying over its empty source code will result in an empty script.\n\nThis does make sense. Variant has confirmed that the issue may not be Windows-specific (I guess it only came up when testing on Windows machines), so this could be why it is happening. I do think it is a bit unintuitive that `Script.duplicate()` doesn't work on exported builds (but it does from the editor), so if this doesn't get resolved then it should probably get documented somewhere.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3765495742/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3768528193","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115063#issuecomment-3768528193","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115063","id":3768528193,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gny1B","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-19T14:10:34Z","updated_at":"2026-01-19T14:10:34Z","body":"> Assuming you me